<title>MALAYSIA: United Malayan Land year net up 59.4 pct.</title>
<headline>United Malayan Land year net up 59.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to July 31</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		53.07	vs	 33.28</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)     72.3	 vs	 45.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		 202.78	vs	207.17</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  74.08	vs	 50.13</p>
<p>    Minorities	less   0.28	vs  less  0.84</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	 11.07	vs	  0.39</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)   15.0	 vs	 12.5</p>
<p>NOTE: The full name of company is United Malayan Land Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
